cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "business-pricing (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  How a price is set and tested: willingness to pay and its measurement, price discrimination and personalised pricing with their law and ethics, anchors and reference prices, and a program that estimates willingness to pay from survey data. Scope only.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tewf"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tewf/business-pricing"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - pricing
  - willingness to pay
  - conjoint analysis
  - personalised pricing
  - behavioural pricing
  - literature review
